Z||000005||Sillhouette.com||05-10-2000||06:46 PM||||Pegasus87 sorry if I openend a can of worms....Hope you're not talking about Race tech as one of the companies that designed the turbo. I will not get into which is better turbo or supercharger I do know that a guy reached 435HP with a 3.8 supercharged (Not dyno confirmed yet) I also know that a turbocharged 3.1 fiero runs 16 seconds at 1/4mile you pick.<P>Later||||reg||1
