Z||000008||Shiner||05-10-2000||08:18 PM||||Sillhouette,<BR> A turbo 3.1 running 16's?  Yeah, maybe on three cylinders with 2psi.  Check out Dennis' site for info on a reliable and fast turbocharged fiero.  <P> Turbo chargers are a beautiful idea.  Free power.  And if done right, can make the 2.8 into an all out screamer.  Most people don't do it the right way, and it does not work out well in the end. (you need a turbo-timer and a new prom chip burned) Supercharging also has it's downsides, which you neglected to mention.<P> ||||reg||1
